From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Haze <patches@haze.invalid>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:34:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Brand the build as Haze in BRANDING

Why: BRANDING feeds the product, company and copyright names into version
resources, the About page, chrome://version and the macOS bundle name and ID,
so one file covers what no string table does. The bundle ID differs from
org.chromium.Chromium so macOS keeps Haze's prefs and permissions apart.
Security-relevant: no
Area: core
---
 chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING | 18 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING b/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
index f8363d5..a914247 100644
--- a/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
+++ b/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
-COMPANY_FULLNAME=The Chromium Authors
-COMPANY_SHORTNAME=The Chromium Authors
-PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Chromium
-PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Chromium
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Chromium Installer
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=Chromium Installer
-COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ The Chromium Authors. All rights reserved.
-MAC_BUNDLE_ID=org.chromium.Chromium
-MAC_CREATOR_CODE=Cr24
+COMPANY_FULLNAME=The Haze Authors
+COMPANY_SHORTNAME=The Haze Authors
+PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Haze
+PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Haze
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Haze Installer
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=Haze Installer
+COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ The Haze Authors. All rights reserved.
+MAC_BUNDLE_ID=org.hazebrowser.Haze
+MAC_CREATOR_CODE=Haze
 MAC_TEAM_ID=
